time.Parse only ever returns *time.ParseError. Since replaces it, under
errors.As(err, &pe), by an fmt.Errorf without %w. Expected: exactly one entry, the
opaque fmt.Errorf "config: since: bad %s in %q"; no *time.ParseError entry may
survive through the trailing "return time.Time{}, err".
